rc_DE = angle_BAC\narc_HJ = angle_BAC\narc_FG = angle_BAC\n\n# Calculate the required sum\nresult = arc_DE + 2 * arc_HJ + 3 * arc_FG\nprint(result)\n```\n```output\n504\n```\nThe calculated value for \\( \\widehat{DE} + 2 \\cdot \\widehat{HJ} + 3 \\cdot \\widehat{FG} \\) is \\( 504 \\). Therefore, the final answer is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{504}\n\\]",
